{"id":7039,"date":"2020-03-21T19:58:44","date_gmt":"2020-03-21T23:58:44","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/?p=7039"},"modified":"2020-03-21T20:04:03","modified_gmt":"2020-03-22T00:04:03","slug":"our-time-in-florida-and-covid-19","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/2020\/03\/21\/our-time-in-florida-and-covid-19\/","title":{"rendered":"Our time in Florida and Covid-19"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p>Things have changed dramatically over the past couple weeks. The virus has seemed to have exploded and as a result we&#8217;ve had to carefully consider our travel and visitation plans.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>We are now in Wauchula Florida where as of yesterday all restaurants are closed except for take-out.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Social distancing and self-quarantine are the norm.  The streets and sidewalks, although not barren, are considerably less crowded.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Before arriving here, we were able to enjoy visits with Dave and Robyn in Crestview, Matt &amp; Sherry along with Larry &amp; Darlene in Bushnell, Ed &amp; Sandy in Orlando, Mike &amp; Deb along with Chuck &amp; Joanne in Wildwood, and Dane &amp; Shiela in Bushnell.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"768\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200307_141330-1024x768.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-7033\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200307_141330-1024x768.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200307_141330-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200307_141330-768x576.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200307_141330-1536x1152.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200307_141330-2048x1536.jpg 2048w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200307_141330-685x514.jpg 685w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200307_141330-2000x1500.jpg 2000w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200307_141330-scaled.jpg 720w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><figcaption>Dave and Robyn.  Dave and I have been good friends since grade school<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"768\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200311_170016-1024x768.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-7034\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200311_170016-1024x768.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200311_170016-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200311_170016-768x576.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200311_170016-1536x1152.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200311_170016-2048x1536.jpg 2048w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200311_170016-685x514.jpg 685w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200311_170016-2000x1500.jpg 2000w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200311_170016-scaled.jpg 720w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><figcaption>RV&#8217;er friends Larry &amp; Darlene, Matt &amp; Sherry along with Kathy and me. We&#8217;ve known these folks since we started RV&#8217;ing and Workamping in 2016<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"768\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200315_134236-1024x768.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-7035\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200315_134236-1024x768.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200315_134236-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200315_134236-768x576.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200315_134236-1536x1152.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200315_134236-2048x1536.jpg 2048w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200315_134236-685x514.jpg 685w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200315_134236-2000x1500.jpg 2000w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200315_134236-scaled.jpg 720w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><figcaption>Ed and Sandy.  Ed lived across the street from me starting in 2nd grade<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"768\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200310_180415-1024x768.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-7036\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200310_180415-1024x768.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200310_180415-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200310_180415-768x576.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200310_180415-1536x1152.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200310_180415-2048x1536.jpg 2048w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200310_180415-685x514.jpg 685w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200310_180415-2000x1500.jpg 2000w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200310_180415-scaled.jpg 720w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><figcaption>We&#8217;ve known Chuck &amp; Joanne since 2017. (Sorry I missed getting a pix of Mike &amp; Deb)<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"768\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200316_145224-1024x768.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-7037\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200316_145224-1024x768.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200316_145224-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200316_145224-768x576.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200316_145224-1536x1152.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200316_145224-2048x1536.jpg 2048w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200316_145224-685x514.jpg 685w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200316_145224-2000x1500.jpg 2000w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200316_145224-scaled.jpg 720w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><figcaption>Shiela and Dane (who I&#8217;ve known since grade school)<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p>But now things are different.  We have to be super conscious of who we spend time with, and from what distance we socialize.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Although some might say we&#8217;re being reckless, the fact is .. we take our home with us, we meet and spend time with only one other couple at a time, and we&#8217;re careful to wash our hands often and be cognoscent of what surfaces we touch.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>We moved the rig from Bushnell to Wauchula on Thursday because our RV friends Paul and Chris have been here a couple months and since we wanted to head to Fort Myers to visit Dave &amp; Judy, Wauchula was a good overnight spot along the way and we could catch up on things with Paul and Chris.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"768\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200321_141442-1024x768.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-7041\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200321_141442-1024x768.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200321_141442-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200321_141442-768x576.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200321_141442-1536x1152.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200321_141442-2048x1536.jpg 2048w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200321_141442-685x514.jpg 685w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200321_141442-2000x1500.jpg 2000w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200321_141442-scaled.jpg 720w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><figcaption>We&#8217;re parked in Overflow.  The shop and a unit in storage are behind us, otherwise we are alone.<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"768\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200321_141448-1024x768.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-7042\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200321_141448-1024x768.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200321_141448-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200321_141448-768x576.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200321_141448-1536x1152.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200321_141448-2048x1536.jpg 2048w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200321_141448-685x514.jpg 685w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200321_141448-2000x1500.jpg 2000w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200321_141448-scaled.jpg 720w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><figcaption>Here&#8217;s another shot of the beautiful Florida SKP RESORT in Wauchula Florida<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p>Unfortunately, the park instituted a new rule the day we arrived. Since we were coming from (who knows where) we are to self-quarantine and have no access to any amenities like the park clubhouse, laundry, or swimming pool.  Think maybe we should get a credit against our 3 night rent?<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>We also couldn&#8217;t visit with Paul and Chris while we were here because of the new rule. Bummer.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>So we stayed Thursday night, got up Friday morning and leaving the coach at the park, we drove our car down to Ft. Myers to spend the night at Dave &amp; Judy&#8217;s home.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"768\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200320_173300-1024x768.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-7043\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200320_173300-1024x768.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200320_173300-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200320_173300-768x576.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200320_173300-1536x1152.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200320_173300-2048x1536.jpg 2048w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200320_173300-685x514.jpg 685w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200320_173300-2000x1500.jpg 2000w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200320_173300-scaled.jpg 720w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><figcaption>We&#8217;ve known Dave &amp; Judy since high school<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p>We had a wonderful visit with Dave and Judy. They took us for a drive Friday night down to Old Town Ft Myers where we were planning on having a nice dinner .. unfortunately the restaurants got the order from the governor at 4pm that afternoon that ALL restaurants in the state were to close their dining rooms. Fr Myers was like a ghost town as we walked the streets.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"768\" src=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200320_180238-1024x768.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-7045\" srcset=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200320_180238-1024x768.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200320_180238-300x225.jpg 300w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200320_180238-768x576.jpg 768w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200320_180238-1536x1152.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200320_180238-2048x1536.jpg 2048w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200320_180238-685x514.jpg 685w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200320_180238-2000x1500.jpg 2000w, https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/03\/IMG_20200320_180238-scaled.jpg 720w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><figcaption>Almost NOBODY downtown Ft Myers Friday night<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p>Tomorrow we will leave Wauchula and head up to Jacksonville where we&#8217;ll spend a couple days visiting with my sister Marilyn and her husband Rick.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>After that we&#8217;ll move on up to Jekyll Island Georgia where we&#8217;ll spend a couple days with friends that we attended church with in Mt Gilead over 30 years ago.  They live in Iowa now but usually winter at Jekyll Island.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>From there we are scheduled to move on up to North Carolina for a Workamping gig in April, May, June and through the July 4th holiday weekend. We&#8217;re having 2nd thoughts about whether that&#8217;s a wise move or not. More on that later as the time gets closer.  Actually &#8230; the decision may be made for us by others (government)<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>More later .. in the meantime if you&#8217;re traveling then safe travels to you. If you&#8217;re staying put, then our best wishes for your good health through this difficult time.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Things have changed dramatically over the past couple weeks. The virus has seemed to have exploded and as a result we&#8217;ve had to carefully consider our travel and visitation plans. We are now in Wauchula Florida where as of yesterday all restaurants are closed except for take-out. Social distancing and self-quarantine are the norm. The &hellip; <a href=\"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/2020\/03\/21\/our-time-in-florida-and-covid-19\/\" class=\"more-link\">Continue reading <span class=\"screen-reader-text\">Our time in Florida and Covid-19<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[406,677,554707329],"tags":[554707872,554707871,554707874,554707500,554707348,554707873],"class_list":["post-7039","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","hentry","category-family","category-friends","category-traveling","tag-corona","tag-covid-19","tag-fever","tag-florida","tag-redford","tag-virus"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/7039","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=7039"}],"version-history":[{"count":5,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/7039\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":7049,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/7039\/revisions\/7049"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=7039"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"category","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/categories?post=7039"},{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/herbnkathy.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=7039"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}